{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c575","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa36-84df-7ea0-97e7-e05c9626f459"},"sequence":277,"recorded_at":1780531400000549,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"c23023ed-e109-49ec-9468-86fe7a097ec0","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"c23023ed-e109-49ec-9468-86fe7a097ec0","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"c23023ed-e109-49ec-9468-86fe7a097ec0"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa37-369d-7110-b940-a79271809f7f"},"task_id":"01a0aa37-369d-7110-b940-a79271809f7f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa37-369d-7110-b940-a79271809f7f","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/.task-board/.resources/BUG-260916-1rqn1c/BUG-260916-1rqn1c_results-rev2.md`.\n1|# BUG-260916-1rqn1c rev2: recovery from CR rev1 gate failure (authoritative handoff evidence)\n2|\n3|Supersedes rev1 validation only. Diagnosis, official toolchain tables, and the\n4|four-path delta are unchanged from `BUG-260916-1rqn1c_results.md` (rev1) and\n5|`BUG-260916-1rqn1c_toolchain-evidence.md`; all four rev1 blobs re-verified\n6|byte-identical in this run (see identities).\n7|\n8|## Why rev1 failed the CR gate (two distinct causes, separated)\n9|\n10|CR rev1 ran the exact candidate gate\n11|`LEGACY_ROOT=.../relux-proxy make credential-free-validate` and stopped at\n12|`validation-contract-tests`, exit 1, with an EMPTY inner log\n13|(`validation-contract-tests.log`, 0 bytes).\n14|\n15|Cause A -- mise trust noise (NOT the failure): the outer log showed\n16|`mise ERROR ... mise.toml ... not trusted`. Source: the metadata block of\n17|`scripts/validate-credential-free.sh` runs `mise exec -- tuist version` with\n18|stdout redirected but stderr leaking to the console; under `set -u` (no `-e`)\n19|the empty substitution does not fail the gate (`relay-packaging` PASSes\n20|after it). Fix: inspected the exact worktree config (`[tools]\n21|tuist = \"4.202.5\"`, byte-identical in HEAD, PR6 head, and worktree) and ran\n22|the brief-authorized `mise trust` BEFORE rerunning the gate. Trust errors\n23|are now gone from the gate log (only a version-update WARN remains).\n24|\n25|Cause B -- the actual failure (this fix caused it, this fix repairs it): the\n26|rev1 runner move (`runs-on: macos-15` -> `macos-26`) tripped the hardcoded\n27|in-repo contract `runner_label=\"    runs-on: macos-15\"` in\n28|`scripts/tests/test-credential-free-validation.sh:55`. `test 0 -eq 1` exits 1\n29|with no output, which is exactly the observed empty-log exit-1. Reproduced\n30|pre-edit in this run: `sh scripts/tests/test-credential-free-validation.sh`\n31|-> exit 1, 0 bytes. The old expectation is wrong because macos-15 cannot\n32|provide the manifest-pinned Xcode 17F42 (official inventory: macos-15 tops\n33|at Xcode 26.3/17C529, default 16.4/16F6 -- the hosted failure itself), so the\n34|contract must track the supported runner. Both causes are now fixed; the\n35|inner log is no longer empty.\n36|\n37|## Recovery delta (one path, in scope)\n38|\n39|`scripts/tests/test-credential-free-validation.sh` (staged PR bytes stay\n40|staged; recovery is unstaged, like ci.yml):\n41|1. `runner_label`: `macos-15` -> `macos-26` plus a 2-line rationale comment.\n42|   All other contract assertions unchanged (mise action pin, version\n43|   2026.3.10, arm64 checksum, install:false, single gate invocation,\n44|   runner<miseline<checksum/gate ordering). The arm64 checksum pairing is\n45|   preserved because macos-26 is the arm64 image.\n46|2. Wired the rev1 regression suites into this existing gate, mirroring the\n47|   adjacent macos-diagnostics precedent (suite + mutant harness, no new job):\n48|   `test_native_toolchain_alignment.py` and\n49|   `test_native_toolchain_mutants.py`. They now run on every local and hosted\n50|   gate invocation. No product, manifest, artifact, or deployment-target\n51|   change; relay matrix runners untouched.\n52|\n53|## Identities (vs PR6 head d45c85d, non-board)\n54|\n55|- Overlay: 59 staged paths, re-verified byte-equal to PR6 head\n56|  (checked=59 mismatch=0). HEAD unmoved at\n57|  `b3422b05226253a17676b9b84c764071fe3dbe74`; nothing committed.\n58|- Rev1 four paths re-verified: ci.yml `205b1001...`,\n59|  select-native-xcode.sh `2489aa2d...`, alignment `d53f9a42...`,\n60|  mutants `75dc0d05...` (full hashes in rev1 outcome).\n61|- Recovery fifth path: `scripts/tests/test-credential-free-validation.sh`\n62|  `156fc56167320226ec6f07fb4bd12d0d35e1d320` ->\n63|  `0163045f360692a9940938d7e34b4f376cf5df03` (+6/-1 lines).\n64|- Prospective PR composition: PR6 head `d45c85d` + these 5 paths.\n65|  Layout: staged = prerequisite overlay; unstaged = ci.yml + contract\n66|  deltas; untracked = selection script + 2 test files.\n67|\n68|## Validation (exact exit codes, no tail masking, composed candidate)\n69|\n70|- Contract step pre-fix: exit 1, 0 bytes (authentic failure reproduced).\n71|- `sh scripts/tests/test-credential-free-validation.sh`: exit 0 --\n72|  scheme fixtures, 1x macos-26 label, mise/arm64/gate assertions,\n73|  provider-graph guard, macos diagnostics 3/3 OK + 3 mutants killed,\n74|  native alignment 12/12 OK + 2 mutants killed, pass banner.\n75|- FULL `LEGACY_ROOT=/Users/iv/Developer/relux-proxy\n76|  make credential-free-validate`: exit 0 -- all 17 stages PASS:\n77|  relay-tool-bootstrap, relay-packaging, validation-contract-tests,\n78|  deterministic-generation, macos-target-builds-and-contracts,\n79|  core-boundaries, swift-testing, swift-release-build, native-packaging,\n80|  legacy-clone, legacy-checkout, legacy-preservation, legacy-guard-tests,\n81|  migration-isolation, migration-isolation-negative-tests,\n82|  legacy-swift-test, legacy-swift-release-build.\n83|- `make check-native-dependencies` (exact hosted failing command): exit 0.\n84|- Strictness preserved: `DEVELOPER_DIR=<Xcode 26.6>`\n85|  `libssh2-fork-tool.py verify` -> exit 1,\n86|  `expected Build version 17F42, got Xcode 26.6 / Build version 17F113`\n87|  (override only, no system mutation; `xcode-select -p` unchanged).\n88|- Workflow YAML parses (same check CI runs); `git diff --check` clean.\n89|- No linter configured in repo (no Makefile lint target, no hidden linter\n90|  configs) -- nothing to run.\n91|\n92|## AC coverage: 4 of 6 rows driven through production entry\n93|\n94|Call sites: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`\n95|(`generated-project-credential-free`) -> `scripts/select-native-xcode.sh`\n96|-> `scripts/libssh2-fork-tool.py verify` (`verify_xcode_build`); gate\n97|contract `scripts/tests/test-credential-free-validation.sh` runs the\n98|credential-free gate hosted and locally.\n99|\n100|1. Narrow reproducible fix -- DRIVEN: runner + selection + tracking\n101|   contract, all green through the production gate (full gate exit 0).\n102|2. Independent review -- STATED BOUND: reviewer stage.\n103|3. Exact prospective PR composition identity -- DRIVEN: identities above.\n104|4. Targeted validation -- DRIVEN: table above, every exit observed.\n105|5. Honest hosted validation requirements -- DRIVEN: this outcome + rev1\n106|   outcome + toolchain-evidence + bounds below.\n107|6. Real hosted publication/landing -- STATED BOUND: parent delivery duty.\n108|\n109|Negative/narrowing evidence (unchanged from rev1, re-run green here):\n110|16F6 and 17F113 rejections, disagreeing/unmapped/missing-pin and\n111|missing-install refusals (exit 2), `admit-macos26-default-only` killed by\n112|the named 17F113 test, `select-wrong-app-preserves-token` (17F42 literals\n113|kept) killed by the full 12-test behavioral suite on the recorded path.\n114|The recovery edit changes a gate expectation value, not gate strength\n115|(exact full-line count == 1 + ordering intact); pre-fix exit 1 vs\n116|post-fix exit 0 through the same production script proves it bites.\n117|\n118|## Bounds (honest, unchanged plus one)\n119|\n120|- Hosted proof (macos-26 + selection => hosted green) still requires\n121|  publishing the prospective PR; a parent delivery gate, not claimed here.\n122|- The image move upgrades the whole credential-free job from Xcode 16.4\n123|  (Swift 6.1) to Xcode 26.5 (Swift 6.3.2-class); all currently-passing\n124|  stages re-verified green LOCALLY on Xcode 26.5 in this run (full gate\n125|  exit 0), hosted confirmation pending by construction.\n126|- No manifest/artifact/product/deployment-target changes; no VPN;\n127|  no global xcode-select change; no publication, commit, or landing.\n128|- New bound: the contract script still fails silently (bare `test`)\n129|  on label mismatch; the empty-log shape is pre-existing and out of\n130|  narrow scope -- diagnosis recorded here instead.\n131|\n132|Ready for review: uncommitted candidate + this outcome handed to review.","final_result":true}}}
